    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald McDermott are delighted to present to the market this three bedroom property ideally positioned on the Melitta Road in Kildare Town.\n\nThis property enjoys an exceptionally convienient location situated within a short walk of Kildare Train Station and all local amentities Kildare town has to offer.\n\nInternally the property offers bright, well proportioned accomodation throughout with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. It includes three bedrooms comprising of two generous double bedrooms and one single bedroom, all of which benefit from built in wardrobes.\n\nOutside the enclosed patio area provides a private, low maintenace outdoor space, it also offers additional storage with a detached block build garage. \n\nWith its excellent location, generous accomodation, good storage and cozy living spaces, 30 Farrenberg Glebe offers a superb opportunity to acquire a home in a highly sought after and convienient location in Kildare Town.\n\nViewings by appointment are highly reccommended to appreciate all this property has to offer.\n\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.77x 4.03\nMarley flooring. Carpeted stairs.Alarm point. Understairs storage.\n\nSitting room - 3.47 x 4.04\nLaminate wooden flooring. Open fireplace. Curtain, pole and blind.\n\nKitchen Diner - 5.35 x 3.26\nMarley flooring. Fitted kitchen. Tiled splashback. Feature brick open fireplace. Door to rear garden\n\nLanding - 2.96 x 1.93\nCarpeted. Curtain and pole.\n\nBathroom - 1.65 x 1.96\nToilet. Sink. Bath and screen. Electric shower\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.28 x 2.91\nLaminate wooden flooring. Built in wardrobe.Curtains and pole\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.61 x 3.86\nLaminate wooden flooring. Built in wardrobes. Curtains and pole.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.73 x2.45\nLaminate wooden flooring. Built in wardrobe, vanity and single bed. Curtains and pole\n\nAiring press - 0.82 x 1.01\n\n\nDetached garage - 2.64 x3.58\nBlock built\n\n"
      }
    ],
